cycletext "wir laaagen vor Sor-Ann-Araah... und hatten 'nen Elf ahan Bord....  In den Kesseln da faulte das Wassah...  da soffen wir Bier soohofort... ", "Blow wi-ind, blow... to Salkamar we go.... her hair was blond her eyes were blue... her lips were red, her axe was new... ter my hodae, ter my hodae, ter my hodae, hodae ho!"
cycletext "#me verwischt den Dreck auf dem Tisch", "#me wipes in the dirt on the table"
cycletext "#me steht in einer Wolke übler Gerüche", "#me stands in a cloud of bad smells"
cycletext "#me trocknet einen Krug mit einem Drecklappen", "#me dries a mug with a dirty rag"
cycletext "#me klaubt sich Krümel aus dem Bart", "#me picks crumbs out of his beard"
cycletext "#me pustet den Staub aus einem Bierkrug", "#me blows dust out of a mug"
cycletext "#me reisst sich Haare aus der Nase", "#me picks hair out of his nose"
cycletext "Von den blauen Wellen kommen wir!... unser Käpt'n iss so blöd wie wir!... an den Rudern unsrer Boote, krieg'n wir Blasen anner Pfote.... von den blauen Wellen kommen wir!...", "oh beat the drum slowly, an' play the flute only, as they carry me along... cause I'm a young pirate, an' I surely done wrong..."
cycletext "#me riecht nach vergammeltem Fleisch und feuchtem Schafsfell", "#me smells of putrefied meat and wet sheepskin"
cycletext "#me kratzt sich abwesend unterm Kilt", "#me scratches himself below his kilt absently"
cycletext "#me sieht sich gelangweilt um", "#me looks around bored"
cycletext "#me trocknet sich mit dem Geschirrtuch unter den Achseln", "#me dries his armpits with the dishrag"
cycletext "#me's Atem riecht nach schalem Bier", "#me's breath smells of stale beer"
